  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The sum of the common terms of the following three arithmetic progressions.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>399</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mn>359</mn></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;and</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>197</mn></math>, is equal to _____ .</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "321",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>359</mn></math></p><p>Common difference is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>399</mn></math></p><p>Common difference is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>197</mn></math></p><p>Common difference is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>Now taking&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>LCM</mi></math>&nbsp;of common difference we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>LCM</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></math></p><p>So, common terms are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>47</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>107</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>167</mn></math>,</p><p>Hence, the sum will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>47</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>107</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>167</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>321</mn></math>.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
